1
00:00:01,633 --> 00:00:06,040
It jumped all night long! Boing, boing, boing! I didn't sleep one bit!

2
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:09,088
A jumping box! Cool! Is it a rocket? I love rockets!

3
00:00:09,438 --> 00:00:11,588
Maybe it's a tiny bunny! Can I hold it? Please?

4
00:00:11,939 --> 00:00:17,135
It's just a box. A loud, shiny box. I hate shiny things.

5
00:00:17,485 --> 00:00:21,154
Don't look at me. I didn't deliver that one. It wasn't on my list.

6
00:00:21,504 --> 00:00:25,003
Then, with a squeak of brakes, the best detective in town arrived.

7
00:00:25,353 --> 00:00:28,788
Inspector Bolt. I heard a boing. Many boings.

8
00:00:29,137 --> 00:00:32,444
Big Bertha. It is your gift. You should open it.

9
00:00:32,794 --> 00:00:35,981
Okay! Everybody, count with me! One, two, three!

10
00:00:37,731 --> 00:00:38,000
It's a ball! A shiny red bouncy ball!
